        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-09T22:25:57.360Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We would love to have the Horizon island boards G and H and/or maybe a few others to add to our collection.  While the six modular boards we have are good, a little variety in set up would be nice and spice up the games a bit.  I understand that being part of Horizons may limit board G and H for a bit, but we’ll take anything we can could get.</p>\n<p>What are the chances of getting a printing of a few more boards?</p>\n<p>Thanks for the wonderful game!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-01-09T22:25:57.360Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
